  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">capacity building partners : safeguarding children training &amp; support in development of policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Risk registers of partners of CAFOD Mozambique demonstrate that the work of most partners has medium to high risk in relation to safeguarding children. CAFOD therefore included in its 3 year rolling plan training for all partners on this subject, followed,if necessary with support to the partner to develop their own child protection policies.

Next risk assessment will then clearly indicate a much lower level of risk in this area.</narrative>
  </description>
